{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/1007d6ca46802e02d699660c99138782.avif?t=1759744605\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/84c1b328d03d5fa50b627955dd703416.poster.avif?t=1759744605\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/84c1b328d03d5fa50b627955dd703416.webm?t=1759744605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/84c1b328d03d5fa50b627955dd703416.mp4?t=1759744605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wild world of influencer culture, where fame is just a click away! In this idler clicker you will build your empire by growing your follower base and watch your popularity soar as the processes get automated. Every follower brings you closer to becoming the ultimate social media sensation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/00c1a9dbc33b396746754c980af6b989.avif?t=1759744605\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/fc68b2042c7be79d2893a86052c249ba.poster.avif?t=1759744605\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/fc68b2042c7be79d2893a86052c249ba.webm?t=1759744605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/fc68b2042c7be79d2893a86052c249ba.mp4?t=1759744605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why settle for slow and steady when you can dominate the game with powerful upgrades? Unlock and buy upgrades to supercharge your clicks, posting skills and follower power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each upgrade brings new ways to grow your empire, making your journey to the top faster and more efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/837f86cc068e0a8318ced2e67265df47.avif?t=1759744605\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/7c9b8e8044a7e4b8274a82d74364727a.poster.avif?t=1759744605\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/7c9b8e8044a7e4b8274a82d74364727a.webm?t=1759744605\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/extras/7c9b8e8044a7e4b8274a82d74364727a.mp4?t=1759744605\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unpredictable world of social media, every milestone brings a new opportunity. Complete challenges to unlock random perks that boost your next fresh hashtag run.  With a wide variety of perks to discover, no two playthroughs are the same. Strategize, adapt, and push your influence to new heights as you tackle harder hashtags with better perk tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes: a single hero character, 3 follower types, 4 currencies, 6 types of upgrades, 9 hashtags to complete, 3 consumables, 23 perks and 26 achievements. For more content be sure to keep an eye out for the full game release.[/p]</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Basic Clicks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/d66ad490e020be4981f620a1cc24635efd84f6af.jpg"},{"name":"Lit Clicks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/9f010342588836808ade59cd05c8d6ce65b733e8.jpg"},{"name":"Fire Clicks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/ddd046f635a359443a4492b24261b9f97313ef05.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Clicks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/9661c316efdd1a6ac56462f59a0c0d440814842d.jpg"},{"name":"Iconic Clicks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/21afcdb863b706080930b7a0ce65a3d4eb431b40.jpg"},{"name":"Basic Red Hearts Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/fed84cc9f60b8191aa29a55ccfdac90ced5ca496.jpg"},{"name":"Lit Red Hearts Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/6fd67f21b4464d52f79587e2e22405cb1e1d796e.jpg"},{"name":"Fire Red Hearts Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/1f1096640c3dcf6aa9b00895c15d57b9245c9f93.jpg"},{"name":"Boss Red Hearts Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/79f5f49784503d3c4acce987610f62d672f05fbd.jpg"},{"name":"Iconic Red Hearts Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3966750/4cfd3d46dea75e7f0e393a2411111b24afa4aa08.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966750?t=1759744605","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/818eb561171c9d5ac4d14f7b6cc2499e0acff700/page_bg_r