 social media, every milestone brings a new opportunity. Complete challenges to unlock random perks that boost your next fresh hashtag run.  With a wide variety of perks to discover, no two playthroughs are the same. Strategize, adapt, and push your influence to new heights as you tackle harder hashtags with better perk tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo includes: a single hero character, 3 follower types, 4 currencies, 6 types of upgrades, 9 hashtags to complete, 3 consumables, 23 perks and 26 achievements. For more content be sure to keep an eye out for the full game release.[/p]</p>","developers":["Austris O.-Anderson"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3534950","name":"Influencer Simulator 25"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966750/9f3406e9343b6a05d414b2c5042f7deb1b210290/header.jpg?t=1759744605","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966750/1792902485/273a77964955bbbb0f306af12c43705962c20617/1755519122/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759744603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966750/1792902485/273a77964955bbbb0f306af12c43705962c20617/1755519122/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759744603","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966750/1792902485/273a77964955bbbb0f306af12c43705962c20617/1755519122/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759744603","id":257184807,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184807/movie480.mp4?t=1759744603","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184807/movie_max.mp4?t=1759744603"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184807/c98c11a7af5356e849a719690343fd6995c09918/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759744603","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25718